Transforms the enemy into a sheep, forcing it to wander around for up to $d. While wandering, the sheep cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly.  

Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form. 

@ext:Only one target can be polymorphed at a time. Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.:ext@

